{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"369c5f393833be477728c7608d6e410bec38f2edc21e9a02190d9e73d46649ac","occurred_at":"2026-11-22T14:46:25Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency scan's directive alternation omits systemd's stop-propagation directives. Because DEPENDENCY_RE already enumerates the relevant [Unit] dependency directives, a unit with `StopPropagatedFrom=crq-tick.service` (or a crq unit with `PropagatesStopTo=...`) can make the fence stop a co-tenant without being detected. Adding both directives to the alternation is the smallest compatible fix and does not require owner judgment.","target":"b164ccbad79badef461308503acb32611bfb4812"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"d226d44ca1d2e6f9002e13070dde0ae48c5edf5391443456e073f9fceee5773f","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:54f74877e664240bcc943e498e46cbd087cd758e33bb7a4c7262eb167c087dfd"}